    fix: gameplay end-to-end — merge conflicts, missing endpoints, broken use_item, UI topbar (#115)
    
    The game was unplayable: login.html had unresolved merge conflict
    markers, the main game topbar was stripped of all action buttons, every
    plot click threw a `ReferenceError`, and critical backend routes/action
    handlers were missing entirely.
    
    ## Merge Conflict Artifacts
    - **`login.html`** — 6 conflict markers made the page fail to parse
    - **`style.css`** — Orphaned `<<<<<<< HEAD` inside `.mission-item` +
    corrupt `>>>>>>> main` at EOF
    
    ## Missing UI (index.html)
    Topbar was a logo-only skeleton. Added all required controls: Shop,
    Inventory, World Tree, Season Pass, Marketplace, Logout,
    coin/diamond/energy counters, weather icon. Removed duplicate `<script>`
    in `<head>`.
    
    ## Critical JS Bug
    Dead code after a block-scoped `const` referenced `action` and `index`
    out of scope — every click on the game board threw `ReferenceError:
    action is not defined`:
    ```js
    // Was (unreachable, undefined vars crash the handler):
    if (action === 'use') performAction('use_item', index, ...);
    
    // Fixed: removed dead block, guard added to plot click path
    const state = plotStates.find(s => s.slot_index === index);
    if (!state) return;
    ```
    
    ## Slot Progression (`use_item`)
    All consumable handlers were missing — using any tool threw `'Ação
    inválida para este slot'`:
    - **`vasoPequeno` / `vasoGrande`** — sets `pot_type`, `pot_expires_at`
    (12h/24h), transitions `needsPot → needsWater` or `readyToPlant`
    - **`pesticida`** — clears `pest_active` with symmetric pause accounting
    (mirrors `remove_crow`)
    - **`espantalho`** — sets `scarecrow_until` (+6h)
    - Crop planting now requires `readyToPlant` phase (enforces
    pot→water→plant flow)
    
    ## Missing Backend Routes
    | Route | Purpose |
    |---|---|
    | `GET /api/game/season-pass` | Player progress + tier rewards |
    | `GET /api/game/marketplace` | Active P2P listings (feature-flagged) |
    | `POST /api/game/checkin` | Daily check-in (+100 coins, +5 energy, +10
    pass XP) |
    
    ## Missing Action Handlers
    - `water_world_tree` — up to 2 contributions/day via config key
    - `collect_tree_reward` — once/day when daily water goal met
    - `buy_pack` — diamond→gold conversion (hardcoded pack_gold_1/2)
    
    ## Additional Fixes
    - **`claim_pass_reward`** — was using non-existent columns
    `reward_item_id`/`reward_amount`; corrected to
    `recompensa_tipo`/`recompensa_quantidade`
    - **`performAction`** — missing `price` param for `marketplace_list`
    - **Admin `promocoes` tab** — referenced `adminData` from a different
    `else if` scope → `ReferenceError`
    - **Admin modal** — opened with `display:block`, breaking flex
    centering; changed to `flex`
    - **CSS** — added missing `.hidden`, `.game-dialog`, and
    `.game-dialog-box` rules
    
    ## Known Limitations
    Season pass, check-in, and marketplace require their respective feature
    flags enabled in `fazenda_features`. World tree contribution tracking
    uses `fazenda_config` as a KV store for per-user daily keys.
    
